sections.text:
An Advocate may be considered for being designated as a Senior Advocate:
(a) On his/her name being proposed by the Chief Justice or any other Judge ofthe High Court of Kerala;
(b) On his/her name being recommended by any two designated Senior Advocates practising in the High Court of Kerala;
(c) On application made by the Advocate concerned, endorsed by two designated Senior Advocates practising in the High Court of Kerala.
